</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span>耗时 15 分钟</span>
<span>·</span>
<span>得分 <strong class="text-on-surface font-semibold">90%</strong></span>
<span>·</span>
<span>今日 08:30 完成</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 self-end md:self-center">
<button class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-outline-variant/50 hover:border-outline text-secondary hover:text-on-surface font-label-sm text-label-sm font-medium transition-colors">
                错因解析
              </button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- 活动 2 -->
<div class="py-3.5 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-surface-container-low/50 px-3 rounded-xl transition-colors">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3.5">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-secondary shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">translate</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
<h4 class="font-body-md text-body-md font-semibold text-on-surface">《高考核心英语词汇 List 14》艾宾浩斯复习</h4>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-semibold bg-primary-fixed text-primary">第3节点达标</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-secondary font-label-sm text-label-sm">
<span>巩固 24 词</span>
<span>·</span>
<span>记忆保持率 <strong class="text-on-surface font-semibold">94%</strong></span>
<span>·</span>
